{"id": "s4-W63-0080", "decision": "fix_clean", "reasons": ["unrecoverable_word", "unrecoverable_word"], "notes": ["raw 'ran' for read, 'Even' for given"], "auditors": ["A", "B"], "clean": "Hi Laura, thanks for sending the plan over. I ran through it last night and I think the shape is right. The emergency fund comes first, six months of expenses, and we agreed on that. The part I'm less sure about is the timeline. Paying off the loan in 18 months feels tight, even the car repair and the trip in the spring. Could we stretch it to two years and see how the numbers look? I'm not trying to be difficult, I just don't want us to be stressed. Let me know what you think and we can sit down on Sunday."}
